# Local secrets. `pnpm dev` copies this to .dev.vars on first run and fills in
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET. Deployed Workers and Previews get their own generated
# secret from `pnpm run deploy` / `pnpm run deploy:preview`. The Deploy to
# Cloudflare button prompts for uncommented values only, so it asks for nothing.

# Generated automatically; set it yourself to pin a value.
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=

# Optional: Better Auth uses the request's origin when this is unset.
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Optional: only needed for the chat example.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
